Effects:
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha becomes true
- route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha becomes false

Now state: origin has task profile linked, route_task_profile unavailable.

Step3: confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

Preconditions:
- candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true)
- vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true)
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true)
- not candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true, initially false)

Effects:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha becomes true

Now state: origin prepared.

Step4: activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true)
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true)
- origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true from init)
