- origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha becomes true
- origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha becomes true
- cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha becomes false

Now state: origin node occupied, origin availability locked, cargo unavailable, origin payload linked.

Step6: unload_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha

Preconditions:
